{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15109020","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1510902001:0":{"text":"당신이 바로 페르세우스, 보칼리스의 지휘관이군.","source_cn":"你就是珀尔修斯，呼临的统帅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6807241E5E986BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510902002:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog68>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22918752BFBA4C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510902003:0":{"text":"아쿠보르인, 전장에서 당신의 얼굴을 본 적은 없는 것 같은데.","source_cn":"雅库伯尔人，我没在战场上见过你的面孔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A5301B6FECA6C6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510902004:0":{"text":"전장에서 만났다면 우리 둘 다 지금 숨이 붙어있지 않겠지.","source_cn":"要是在战场上相遇，你我不会都活着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD504A15D74BBF040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510902005:0":{"text":"하지만 적어도 지금은 당신과 적이 될 생각이 없다.","source_cn":"至少现在，我不准备与你为敌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x173869779AA5DE78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8