_title_status":""},"say:15:1510902011:1":{"text":"특히, 페르세우스 당신 말이에요.","source_cn":"尤其是你，珀尔修斯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3981F962F4ECB6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510902012:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog69>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42527A16008D3B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1510902012":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42527A16008D3B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510902013:0":{"text":"루... 루는 신의 사도도 아니고, 산 제물도 아니었다.","source_cn":"露……她不是神使，更没有活祭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE68C42799E0339F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510902014:0":{"text":"사냥의 신 오르파가가 했던 말과 행동... 대체 뭐가 진실이란 말인가.","source_cn":"狩猎神奥法迦，她说的那些话，做的那些事……到底哪些才是真的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x538F83CD4F4D51BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510902015:1":{"text":"사랑을 믿었는데... 왜 진실은 이렇게 잔인하고 추악한 거지?","source_cn":"我以为我得到了爱……可真相为何如此丑陋？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B3AACD7F805F